    "detailed_description": "One hit death bullet hell action featuring upgrades, unlockable abilities, hats and y\u0334\u034co\u0337\u0340\u0350u\u0337\u0341\u0344.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">    - Movement </h2>Fluid movement and dashing, which can of course be upgraded. Your dodging skills will be tested.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893950/extras/48445b08fc24ee2509574413e6126929.poster.avif?t=1754385433\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893950/extras/48445b08fc24ee2509574413e6126929.webm?t=1754385433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893950/extras/48445b08fc24ee2509574413e6126929.mp4?t=1754385433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">    - Enemies </h2>Providing a constant stream of obstacles while getting smarter and gaining more attacks incrementally, still perfect for destroying.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893950/extras/7b629247187572576f1b5a5530a19f2c.poster.avif?t=1754385433\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893950/extras/7b629247187572576f1b5a5530a19f2c.webm?t=1754385433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893950/extras/7b629247187572576f1b5a5530a19f2c.mp4?t=1754385433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">    - Upgrades </h2>Plenty of upgrades and abilities to buy to try and match your enemies\u2019 increasing difficulty.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893950/extras/ba8bff6f87d6a27f8d70b5236ba7fe27.poster.avif?t=1754385433\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893950/extras/ba8bff6f87d6a27f8d70b5236ba7fe27.webm?t=1754385433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893950/extras/ba8bff6f87d6a27f8d70b5236ba7fe27.mp4?t=1754385433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">    - Minigames and Cosmetics </h2>Purchase cosmetics for your square earned by completing levels and getting highscores in minigames.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">    - Music </h2>Featuring an original Synthwave soundtrack by Makazi the Hyena.<br><br><br><br><br><br><br>Who are you?<br>Do you know how it all started?<br>Who made you?",
    "about_the_game": "One hit death bullet hell action featuring upgrades, unlockable abilities, hats and y\u0334\u034co\u0337\u0340\u0350u\u0337\u0341\u0344.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">    - Movement </h2>Fluid movement and dashing, which can of course be upgraded. Your dodging skills will be tested.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893950/extras/48445b08fc24ee2509574413e6126929.poster.avif?t=1754385433\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893950/extras/48445b08fc24ee2509574413e6126929.webm?t=1754385433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893950/extras/48445b08fc24ee2509574413e6126929.mp4?t=1754385433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">    - Enemies </h2>Providing a constant stream of obstacles while getting smarter and gaining more attacks incrementally, still perfect for destroying.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893950/extras/7b629247187572576f1b5a5530a19f2c.poster.avif?t=1754385433\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893950/extras/7b629247187572576f1b5a5530a19f2c.webm?t=1754385433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893950/extras/7b629247187572576f1b5a5530a19f2c.mp4?t=1754385433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">    - Upgrades </h2>Plenty of upgrades and abilities to buy to try and match your enemies\u2019 increasing difficulty.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893950/extras/ba8bff6f87d6a27f8d70b5236ba7fe27.poster.avif?t=1754385433\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893950/extras/ba8bff6f87d6a27f8d70b5236ba7fe27.webm?t=1754385433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893950/extras/ba8bff6f87d6a27f8d70b5236ba7fe27.mp4?t=1754385433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">    - Minigames and Cosmetics </h2>Purchase cosmetics for your square earned by completing levels and getting highscores in minigames.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">    - Music </h2>Featuring an original Synthwave soundtrack by Makazi the Hyena.<br><br><br><br><br><br><br>Who are you?<br>Do you know how it all started?<br>Who made you?",
